From 6b4dddeb5c79744a2b99094a58d5499b36439e61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:30:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 26/31] riscv: configs: a210: enable cpufreq, rpmsg, BMU and
 quad-SPI

These are the only drivers the vendor's own a210_evb_defconfig builds
that ours did not: they were carried in-tree but left disabled through
the mainline port.  Enable them to reach parity with the vendor's board
configuration:

  - RISCV_ZHIHE_CPUFREQ / RISCV_XUANTIE_TH1520_CPUFREQ: CPU DVFS (the
    A210's cpufreq node + per-cluster OPP tables are already in the DTS).
  - RPMSG_TH1520: the th1520 AON co-processor rpmsg transport.  No A210
    DTS node instantiates it (same as the vendor tree), so it is built
    but dormant on this board.
  - A210_BMU: the DDR/GPU/NPU/PCIe bus-monitor units (nodes present).
  - SPI_DW_QUAD: quad-mode DesignWare SPI (controller nodes present).

All dependencies (ZHIHE_AON, TH1520_AON, REGULATOR_TH1520_AON, THEAD_CLK,
PM_OPP) are default-y/selected and come on automatically.  The previously
deferred driver sources needed 7.x API fixups, done in the parent commit.

Co-developed-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/riscv/configs/a210_evb_defconfig | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/a210_evb_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/a210_evb_defconfig
index 958870accf304..6de059f2448fe 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/configs/a210_evb_defconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/configs/a210_evb_defconfig
@@ -63,6 +63,8 @@ CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_GOV_POWERSAVE=y
 CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_GOV_USERSPACE=y
 CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_GOV_ONDEMAND=y
 CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_GOV_CONSERVATIVE=y
+CONFIG_RISCV_XUANTIE_TH1520_CPUFREQ=y
+CONFIG_RISCV_ZHIHE_CPUFREQ=y
 CONFIG_KPROBES=y
 CONFIG_MODULES=y
 CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y
@@ -262,6 +264,7 @@ CONFIG_I2C_CHARDEV=y
 CONFIG_I2C_SMBUS=m
 CONFIG_I2C_DESIGNWARE_PLATFORM=y
 CONFIG_SPI=y
+CONFIG_SPI_DW_QUAD=y
 CONFIG_SPI_DESIGNWARE=y
 CONFIG_SPI_DW_MMIO=y
 CONFIG_SPI_SPIDEV=y
@@ -438,8 +441,10 @@ CONFIG_MAILBOX=y
 CONFIG_RISCV_IOMMU=y
 CONFIG_RPMSG_CHAR=y
 CONFIG_RPMSG_CTRL=y
+CONFIG_RPMSG_TH1520=y
 CONFIG_RPMSG_VIRTIO=y
 CONFIG_A210_POWER_DOMAIN=y
+CONFIG_A210_BMU=y
 CONFIG_A210_D2D=m
 CONFIG_EXTCON=y
 CONFIG_IIO=y
